{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "9b2a7b64c0cbf826a8b9026ab5c7ce1aa6cf058204595a132dcac757b63e9a5f", "ja": "初めての……体験♪", "zh": "初次的……体验♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "985772b1fb98d9b8871e3562d0a85d8ce9b2371e0e7dd0e673de01e2fb53b2fe", "ja": "莉緒のオススメのエステに行く4人。\n何故かプロデューサーも施術を受ける事に。\nエステの後、劇場で稽古の続きを行う。何故\nか歌織の相手役を務めるプロデューサー。\nそれぞれの稽古の終わりが、見え始める。", "zh": "四人前往莉绪推荐的美容沙龙，\n却莫名演变成连制作人也要接受疗程。\n护肤结束后，众人回到剧场继续排练，\n不知怎的就由制作人饰演与歌织对戏的角色。\n至此，每个人的排练也差不多接近尾声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fe4be34c538994109efd59cd2064b9be67fb28db62b28496d6f22fb28ba82b09", "ja": "（クランクインに向けた準備は順調に進んでいる。\n今日の稽古は夜から……のはずだったのだが……）", "zh": "（开镜前的准备进行得很顺利。\n今天的排练……原本应该晚上才开始……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "13d125dca54649b52fbafbb342154fc1ff2c79d652c8fdcbd9385513b63daf32", "ja": "さてっ、みんな準備はいい？\nいよいよお楽しみの、アレに行くわよ！", "zh": "好，大家准备好了吗？\n我们终于要去期待已久的那个啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9c5fd7cd1e7bf54d16fc2500f055c6c43e7538dda50619b1b149b2c78a68bbb5", "ja": "……『アレ』というのは、一体……？", "zh": "……『那个』到底是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8f9919f12535f45a3f62e67a31f5571a3dee39426f847c0732d8ae63d04b1716", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　実はこの前、\n莉緒さんがオススメのエステを教えてくれたんですよ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n其实之前莉绪推荐一家美容沙龙给我们喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "95339e69d253396f4ef5907546b1b53b0100c2b17e0fd7229223541acb16aed5", "ja": "ドラマでも、エステに行くシーンがありますよね。\nでも私達、このみさん以外はエステ未経験で……。", "zh": "电视剧里不是也有前往美容沙龙的情节吗？\n但是除了木实以外，我们都没去过美容沙龙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3043e7dc2c12dff7896e8711d8a5fa623eeefda3e7ffdb5b81777fc280943472", "ja": "だから、今日はみんなで予定を合わせて、\nエステに行こうってことになったんです♪", "zh": "所以大家就决定好，\n今天要一起排出时间去美容沙龙♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "28ff1b8c0e2665fd30782ef44717e8b48220e5660334de1c92fe24b4d9c91bd7", "ja": "なるほど、エステか……\nそれは確かに、いい経験になりそうだ。", "zh": "原来如此，美容沙龙啊……\n确实会是不错的经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0b629c2b60505cda393d134bf7c2ca216130ea25143ebbf1e7c1fe971b4f0319", "ja": "このみさん、みんなをよろしくお願いしますね。\nみんなも楽しんで……", "zh": "木实，就麻烦你照顾她们啰。\n大家也要好好享……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "facf4f0c17df8f49a4542ba2d42f2cdf212940ad654079196c40683dde31be29", "ja": "あっ、いいこと思いついちゃいました！\n{$P$}さんも一緒に行きましょう♪", "zh": "啊，我想到一个好主意！\n{$P$}先生也一起去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ae1a415cd4a3ac94a2737b52919940d7316ca0b3d783a94d9a2de56382ce71b6", "ja": "なんで俺まで！？\n俺の肌がツヤツヤとかになっても仕方ないだろ？", "zh": "为什么连我都要去！？\n我的皮肤变得光滑也没用吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "b16f741bd2c5f73728f2626efe070cd9c75da4ad50419d9c97201b0d35763a19", "ja": "でも、男の方が受けられるメニューもあるみたい\nですし……。とってもリラックスできるそうですよ？", "zh": "但是，好像也有针对男性的疗程……\n似乎会让人非常放松喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "92a3ef87482a7f1b144dca71ddb443798ffccc5978910a7c5b52c83c0624ceea", "ja": "ストレス発散にも、とってもいいと思うわ。\nこの際だし、一緒に行かない？", "zh": "我想应该会非常有助于纾解压力，\n你要不要趁这个机会一起去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "42b366612ce7ed8424c4aa8531f1422988442b37d1507c457856741d37ab74bc", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。\nそれじゃあ、行ってみようかな？", "zh": "是、是吗……\n那我就去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "1c9892dc3c03fee7eccedef219387427e534ba15fe869e456196502b16df074f", "ja": "わーい♪　莉緒さんが、エステティシャンさんは\n魔法が使えるって言ってました！", "zh": "耶～♪\n莉绪说过美容师会使用魔法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "e7d0c178bc99cdc893814ac838c15def611f8d87d74fed8fdddefa821f192a30", "ja": "どんな人体マジックが{$P$}さんに\n起こるか、今から楽しみですね♪", "zh": "不知道{$P$}先生身上，\n会出现什么样的人体魔法，我现在就好期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e98503d92cfb145c124b25ad351d4dbd8374fe95985256fc64460bd58991780b", "ja": "いや、そういうのじゃないと思うんだが……\nま、とにかく行ってみるか！", "zh": "等等，我觉得应该不是你想的那样……\n唉，总之就去试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1016_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d4e539358b71a9f6582237ad07dc632b4370bfd42664ba634473a5ad47992354", "ja": "（いざ、こうしてエステに来ると、\n少し緊張するな……。一体どんな感じなんだろう）", "zh": "（实际踏进美容沙龙，让人有点紧张呢……\n到底会是什么感觉？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1018_esutetexisyan", "source_sha256": "2144bfdb41662dfe10f8eadb80f857c52da12d1a3b9234fb3d33b2f1ca3a8017", "ja": "本日はよろしくお願いします～。\nでは、始めますね～。力を抜いて～。それ～っ。", "zh": "今天就请您多多配合啰～\n那么，我要开始了～请放松身体～嘿～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3cce701a0bf8185b55c9ecec0f98d6313aeed2b0a70905f22a9ecae768d674b2", "ja": "あ、あたたたたたっ！　痛い、思ってたより痛い！\n莉緒はいつもこんなのを受けてたのか！？", "zh": "好、好痛痛痛痛痛！好痛，比我想像中还要痛！\n莉绪平时都在接受这种按摩吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1020_esutetexisyan", "source_sha256": "0a408f7ed1abefbafacb4b2117ef114cb7d79501df98fd19ec6564543d6ef050", "ja": "老廃物が溜まってますね～。\nもう少し強くいきますよ～？　え～いっ！", "zh": "身体里堆积了许多老废物质呢～\n我要稍微用力一点喔～嘿～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f5eeb373fbe7ae59249512eff55c5bd866430982c35cde1a86461c853d0cec08", "ja": "ぐわーっ！", "zh": "唔哇──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "617d9bf823d24d902b73cf8a641fb67062d83f8c171f57f7ca786958783f6730", "ja": "……といいつつ、なんやかんやで気持ちよかったな。\n疲れがとれた気がする。", "zh": "……虽然痛得哇哇叫，但还是挺舒服的。\n感觉身体的疲劳都纾解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e1e7a368a556991feb3c991e7bd63c3a19daf1663bd3d95613011519d6eb7c46", "ja": "ふふっ。何だか、いつもよりちょっと\nかっこよく見えますよ、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "呵呵，总觉得你看起来比平常帅一点喔，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "514e55a787eb31dc44b0c6ed3eff708553b5e77a9537100b3fdfda05acbe67a5", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\nそういう風花も、いつも以上に綺麗になったな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢称赞。\n风花你也是，变得比平常更漂亮了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "61124bdf2416e79070ce0494b487d9479f49ebd1d3a7b78d63189e4576fcfed9", "ja": "えっ！\nも、もう{$P$}さん……っ♪", "zh": "咦！\n讨、讨厌啦，{$P$}先生……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "b8d8242232d68ad1ba5c5d02282dc7d0f8706332fa5a12892ddfaf8fdb2eb34b", "ja": "そ、その……。私も、少しは変わったでしょうか、\n{$P$}さん……？", "zh": "请、请问……我是不是也稍微有点不一样了呢，\n{$P$}先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "272411b25c757003ce985d0da53e04135244fc67ef5bc02c11089be0644c48ce", "ja": "もちろんです。歌織さんの大人の魅力が、\nぐんと増した気がします。", "zh": "那是当然的啰。\n歌织小姐的成熟魅力感觉一口气增加了许多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "a8457a3e9d16e4094b998ba95c2fefc58d46da4963f896f4c23e81025f31c232", "ja": "まあ……！\nふふ、エステに来て良かったです……♪", "zh": "哎呀……！\n呵呵，有来美容沙龙真是太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "287cac97fd46635606e29d23187e3508fc5fafeec650e5917a70b820d1b0d8e0", "ja": "このみさんは、小学生みたいなお肌だって\nエステティシャンさんに褒められてましたね♪", "zh": "木实还被美容师称赞，\n说她的肌肤跟小学生一样喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "0418d59a78497d965f751e9e24a465da6becb55ca26f06bbb58ffad5ea4ec331", "ja": "ムギギ……。子ども扱いされてるみたいで、\nあんまり褒められた気はしないけれど……。", "zh": "唔唔唔……听起来就像把我当成小孩子，\n总觉得没有被称赞到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "ddbdc72b0c4020bf1429fb26ce62736a003e73159c8a0fa1b377fd3f5a1013a8", "ja": "まあ、日頃のお手入れの成果ってことよね！\nうんうん。さ、劇場に帰って、今日の稽古よっ！", "zh": "不过，这就是平日里保养的成果吧！\n没错没错～好了，我们回剧场开始今天的排练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c86c1789c5c53cd7b8a2aee349b8e317eaa23c157ba5e1260f13d813c2d03de5", "ja": "準備できたら、さっそく始めましょう。今日は佳織が\nパーティーを抜け出すシーンからですが……。", "zh": "准备好以后，就马上开始吧。\n今天要从佳织偷溜出派对的情节开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "ebecbff48a4e3600b159c79fc44dd8332aa38bc1f3708f5cb7d8f6f502de06ea", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん？\n私のお相手役の男性なんですが、これはどなたが……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生？\n这一幕跟我对戏的男性角色，该请哪一位来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "00ab85b498c22d5a33718db1c02590bf06fd79d8d6e28d2fc71883b95d458ea1", "ja": "もちろん、エステでお肌もばっちりな、\nスベスベデューサーさんが適任だと思います！", "zh": "我认为最适合的人选，当然就是去过美容沙龙后，\n肤况无懈可击的美肌制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8258023a053520a0541fb6a6fc8a83a522db3092b6fb677a0946aa85cb92695b", "ja": "それは俺のことなのか……？", "zh": "那是在说我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "27140d84548c28380edbd38e7ef28e090a32291cee20eb6bbb7b36d2768517d7", "ja": "そうね。私が男性役をしてもいいんだけど、\nせっかく本物がいるんだもの。", "zh": "也对。虽然也可以由我来反串男性角色，\n但刚好有个现成的男人在这里嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7dfa0e8db17774f6fb1c34f187d623ad6bd6a21924fa506cd680342bd36e0b70", "ja": "雰囲気も出ますしね！　{$P$}さん、\nひと肌脱いでもらえませんか？　なんて♪", "zh": "这样演起来也更有气氛呢！\n{$P$}先生，能请你帮我们这个忙吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "c0b5b2f313ff1cdd6700a11ea9e0e5f95576e9f02a80a94b65984da018976670", "ja": "……わかった。みんながそういうなら、\n代役、精いっぱい頑張ってみます！", "zh": "……好吧。既然大家都这么说，\n我会努力代演这个角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "ddc6664385b6ee315f08fc276168da72594bb7bfecf8fb145575c4ed976add89", "ja": "えっと、台本は……ここですね。\n佳織を追いかけながら……。了解です！", "zh": "我看看，剧本在……在这里呢。\n追上佳织后……我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "1fbee0e8fb8238576891789732a7fe800d62ccd9bb2663ad40bdab075ab980a7", "ja": "あ、あの、佳織さんっ！", "zh": "那、那个，佳织小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "978a4b7b49661cad009e2deeff629af45f01c14490f345e4522badf7fe2574c0", "ja": "あっ、あなたは……パーティー会場でご挨拶してくれた\nえっと……そうだ、877商事の北大路さん？", "zh": "你、你是……在派对会场跟我打过招呼的……\n对了，877商事的北大路先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "473a638f82d3f0c64a8f093ca3212afec10844ef986bbf7d6e17a901bf43bae5", "ja": "憶えていてくれたんですね。嬉しいな……。今日は\nオヤジ……いえ、父に無理やり連れてこられて……。", "zh": "你记得我呀，真开心……今天是我老爸……\n不对，是家父强迫我来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "5646acf577656dff25e6653e4961a7947183a5d009587b9fd80db67fd4387c3d", "ja": "でも、来たかいがありました。佳織さんみたいな人が\nいたなんて。たまには父の言う事も聞くものですね。", "zh": "但能遇见像佳织小姐这样的人，让我觉得来这趟是对的。\n偶尔也应该听一听父亲的话呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1044_052kao", "source_sha256": "e84c9e57e896c0c0252634e0d8b0e03028ed1eca9201b17fb147c5aae231e6fe", "ja": "あ、あの、それはどういう……？", "zh": "请、请问，你这话的意思是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "f49b7a42cb7508a03e0d5ed7f6e0928c614d22de9958576b0f0ca992f3ff0206", "ja": "今度、国立歌劇場で上演される話題のオペラのチケット\nがあるんです。よかったら、一緒に観に行きませんか？", "zh": "我手上有国立歌剧院近期将上演的热门歌剧门票。\n你方便的话，要不要跟我一起去看呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "ba039c5a206b37e93046c7efc90603925cb6cb3f45282cc279bac1f71a5d3c26", "ja": "あの……、それで僕は、真剣に、佳織さんと\nお付き合いがしたいんです！　付き合ってください！", "zh": "那个……还有，我是非常认真想跟佳织小姐交往！\n请你跟我交往！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "2c0a14c4dee7358fb8f50f67a06bbe0bf06edbc8edf55ef416055500e6928c1f", "ja": "…………っ。", "zh": "…………唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "8f483bc02d2df1a1a5b44e5f5e0264e900ed0cf5a64384f45b7d46b166b172a7", "ja": "あれ？　あの、歌織さん？\n次のセリフを……。", "zh": "咦？我说，歌织小姐？\n下一句台词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1053_052kao", "source_sha256": "a01a7bc9a96b32b5cc1e17c9c7cc3fe4372db2375e6d64e7d51b6c2f30518c1a", "ja": "す、すいません{$P$}さんっ！\n私、セリフが……と、とんでしまって……っ。", "zh": "对、对不起，{$P$}先生！\n我、我忘记……台词了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1054_039kon", "source_sha256": "138c932661222713bffcb284cf46955cc43f3409c44ef8938ce42f61402877d6", "ja": "し、しかたないわよ歌織ちゃん！　今日初めてのパート\nだものっ。でも、さすがドラマ。急展開よねっ！", "zh": "这、这也没办法嘛，歌织！毕竟这段今天是初次排练。\n不过，真不愧是电视剧，发展好迅速！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1055_048rei", "source_sha256": "3195f2953d3308f36f8d7a6241fa8b9312ff9179754069146e7e31e676d0dfc5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ナイス普通の演技\nでした！　歌織さんも、とってもよかったですよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生的演技平凡得让人赞叹！\n歌织也表现得非常棒喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1056_052kao", "source_sha256": "aeea2be34d5918c2390638e812f315ec71a808f52efdd06cb7209aa0229115ae", "ja": "ごめんなさい、ああ、あの……\nもう一度台本を覚え直しておきますっ！", "zh": "对不起，那那、那个……\n我再去重新背一次剧本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1057_039kon", "source_sha256": "811ad3ef21a7993c5c03c566375632f5511c762f0c570b863a156833a9b48a1d", "ja": "じゃあ、次は風花ちゃんのシーンね。\nさあ、どんどん行きましょう！", "zh": "那接下来是风花的桥段吧。\n来，我们继续排练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1058_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1059_p", "source_sha256": "dbdaaf461c4c6bd252ce348b05a5712c6a9897dd8dc95227ae211ef93f0f71c4", "ja": "じゃあ、この辺でいったん休憩にしましょう。\nみんな水分補給をわすれないように。", "zh": "那么，我们就练到这边先休息一下吧。\n大家不要忘记补充水分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1060_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a8ca4e1efa0525b96023402f38d1c89bb327d548c621ab3a07f18b18a9f2dfe2", "ja": "はい、水分は大切ですよね。ドラマも盛り上がって\nきて、なんだか演じてて汗かいちゃいますから……。", "zh": "对，补充水分很重要呢。剧情开始高潮迭起，\n总觉得演着演着就流了好多汗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1061_039kon", "source_sha256": "1c3f5de986ab6a2769ef0cd43f111526cd6644076e53c142d33df2c092d64445", "ja": "うふふ、セレブパーティーを切っ掛けに、みんな\nワンランク上の、新たな出会いの連続ねっ！", "zh": "呵呵，借由名流派对，\n大家接连邂逅了社经地位比自己高的男性呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1062_039kon", "source_sha256": "e5205543b852a38613d94d5bcf3226d117abd2a036f86ba51c2d4ab5a7548d78", "ja": "好美の前には、そんな彼女を支えたいっていう、\nやり手の政治家秘書が姿を現すし……。", "zh": "在好美面前，也出现了一位精明能干的政治家秘书，\n表达出想要支持她的意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1063_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0b418f9e62b6833eb46bdaa30addbd80fed474534b66d460ecd727a6c83cc2ba", "ja": "パーティーで注目される楓果と、ソーイチローの\n再会シーンとか……。早く本番で演じたいです♪", "zh": "还有在派对引人注目的枫果，与总一郎重逢的情节……\n真想快点正式演出这一幕♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1064_p", "source_sha256": "a521680a01d52d7de66c8871dcdcd436f973476a0f44f00efa5ae5139003ee85", "ja": "へえ、そんなシチュエーションもあったのか。\n風花、どんな感じなんだ？", "zh": "是喔，还有那种情节啊。\n风花，内容大概是怎样的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1065_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6b9bae8284422774e9f8a0f4491184a15e5581b36bcee6719f6dba3e80010f03", "ja": "えっと、よりを戻したくなった\nソーイチローに向かって……、こうやって……。", "zh": "呃，总一郎想跟我再续前缘……\n我则是回答他……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1066_041fuk", "source_sha256": "13b497041d237dc08923697a1dd6760ec5f540f9e6946280f76b1f100f660eab", "ja": "ソーイチローさんのその気持ち……。\n昨日までだったら、うれしかったかな♪", "zh": "总一郎先生的这份心意……\n如果是昨天之前的我，可能会很高兴吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1067_p", "source_sha256": "58a22b9301fe0a111244399c8dd6b046966261b040137bc3719d026a5a7c01d9", "ja": "おお……、すごいな！", "zh": "哦哦……真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1068_039kon", "source_sha256": "33412a32f55acd0278ae7ecacda68b18b73034b223f7a091bda8e43153b49e3a", "ja": "ふふっ、いい女になれてると思うわ。\nやるわね、風花ちゃん♪", "zh": "呵呵，我觉得你演出了一名出色的女性。\n真了不起，风花♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1069_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c10d2e606ecef57ae8be492e184250dd32f1743fb026b984072969d7edfd21c2", "ja": "ふふ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1070_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2b3b7efc44dde7273054adc0e631ce3194a435334bb69b89f249e6cd303d8844", "ja": "あとは玲香が、自分に寄ってくる男性達に相撲をさせて\nデート相手を決めるシーンも気になりますけど……。", "zh": "还有就是，玲香要求接近自己的男性们相扑，\n借此决定约会对象，我也很关注这场戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1071_p", "source_sha256": "3a67062c26f10cbcdad9e98c335feaf7cfe6ad1e34b6e9357aea94194ba34533", "ja": "それは気になるな……。\n本当にやるのか、という意味でだけど……。", "zh": "这场戏的确很让人在意……\n不过我关注的是，真的要比赛相扑吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1072_048rei", "source_sha256": "1baf35967edad675fead63673f3d68e0983745cb50eaffb3369377eb71681562", "ja": "はい、任せてください{$P$}さん。\n今からきちんと稽古をつけておきますね♪", "zh": "是的，请包在我身上，{$P$}先生。\n我会从现在开始好好练习♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1073_p", "source_sha256": "fab015908bd4ad330d610759c543f6c288321b22c56b39f7420bf196ce56e7dc", "ja": "（まさか相撲に混ざる気か……？）", "zh": "（她不会是想一起比赛相扑吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1074_052kao", "source_sha256": "8ca269d5ee5de9da5148f0cdff5cc9530b1105cf9de7d6919248d984be2ee637", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん……。次はセリフ、\nきちんと言えるように練習しておきますね。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生……我会好好练习，\n确保下次能顺利说出台词。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1075_p", "source_sha256": "5f1921cda3b1255ef086c6ed5593f542c9bb075c5c5614f65f008a83b6d10479", "ja": "ええ、大丈夫です歌織さん。こうやってセリフを覚え\nていくのも稽古ですから。この調子でいきましょう！", "zh": "嗯，没问题的，歌织小姐。像这样逐步背好台词，\n也是排练的目的。就按照现在的步调继续加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1076_052kao", "source_sha256": "5987e88f3eead613c8ffe0b7e789ced24487d5d115626da9afadae15b106656e", "ja": "はい……。次は{$P$}さんが\nお相手でも、最後までできるように……がんばります！", "zh": "好的……我会努力练习，即使下次又跟\n{$P$}先生对戏……我也要顺利演完！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_05_1077_p", "source_sha256": "33b97420478a9f024e446329e1bd60f0d2d460621ed08bfed8a05bd46044ecd3", "ja": "（エステに稽古に、みんなの気分はどんどん高まってい\nる！　これなら最高のクランクインになりそうだな！）", "zh": "（经历护肤跟排练，大家的斗志越来越高昂！\n这下应该能迎接最棒的开镜！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
